	(descr "Atari 7800 32-pin cartridge edge: 18 positions at 2.54 mm per face, positions 3 and 16 are key slots (board notches, drawn by gen_pcb); pins 1-16 F.Cu (component side, console rear, pin 1 left), pins 17-32 B.Cu, pin k over pin 33-k; pins 3-14 / 19-30 are the 2600 edge.  Fingers 1.5 x 7.0 mm from 0.5 mm in.  Hard gold, bevel.")
